#: ../../source/intro/credits.rst:3
msgid "Credits"
msgstr "크레딧"

#: ../../source/intro/credits.rst:5
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter was originally developed by `EllisLab  "
"<https://ellislab.com/>`_. The framework was written for performance in "
"the real world, with many of the original class libraries, helpers, and "
"sub-systems borrowed from the code-base of `ExpressionEngine "
"<https://expressionengine.com>`_. It was, for years, developed and "
"maintained by EllisLab, the ExpressionEngine Development Team and a group"
" of community members called the Reactor Team."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter는 원래 `EllisLab <https://ellislab.com/>`_\\ 에 의해 개발되었습니다. "
"이 프레임워크는 실제 환경에서의 성능을 위해 작성되었으며, 원본 클래스 라이브러리, 헬퍼 및 서브시스템의 많은 부분이 "
"`ExpressionEngine <https://expressionengine.com>`_\\ 의 코드베이스에서 가져왔습니다. "
"수년간 EllisLab, ExpressionEngine 개발팀, 그리고 Reactor Team이라 불리는 커뮤니티 멤버 그룹이 "
"개발 및 유지관리를 담당했습니다."

#: ../../source/intro/credits.rst:13
msgid ""
"In 2014, CodeIgniter was acquired by the `British Columbia Institute of "
"Technology <https://www.bcit.ca/>`_ and was then officially announced as "
"a community-maintained project."
msgstr ""
"2014년, CodeIgniter는 `브리티시컬럼비아 기술연구소 <https://www.bcit.ca/>`_\\ 에 인수되어 "
"커뮤니티 유지 프로젝트로 공식 발표되었습니다."

#: ../../source/intro/credits.rst:17
msgid ""
"In 2019, the CodeIgniter Foundation was formed to provide a perpetual "
"managing group separate from any other entity to help ensure the "
"framework's future."
msgstr ""
"2019년, CodeIgniter Foundation이 설립되어 프레임워크의 미래를 보장하기 위해 다른 어떤 단체와도 독립된 "
"영구적인 관리 그룹을 제공하게 되었습니다."

